          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of Zebulun, such as were able to go out in the host, that could set the battle in array, with all manner of instruments of war, fifty thousand, and that could order ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " not of double heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And of Naphtali a thousand captains, and with them with shield and spear thirty and seven thousand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And of the Danites that could set the battle in array, twenty and eight thousand and six hundred. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
