          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these, being men of war, that could order the battle array, came with a perfect heart to Hebron, to make David king over all Israel: and all the rest also of Israel were of one heart to make David king. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they were there with David three days, eating and drinking; for their brethren had made preparation for them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover they that were nigh unto them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " as far as Issachar and Zebulun and Naphtali, brought bread on asses, and on camels, and on mules, and on oxen, victuals of meal, cakes of figs, and clusters of raisins, and wine, and oil, and oxen, and sheep in abundance: for there was joy in Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
